        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "For challenge 2, PE EVSE manufacturers and OEMs do not install the trust anchors for the leaf certificates that their devices/EVs are allowed to work with. The user performs some explicit actions on both the PE EVSE and the vehicle to install the necessary trust anchors. This will be a one-time action if the same PE EVSE and the same vehicle are used. It may be performed again if the EV visits different PE EVSEs (see Figure H.11 for details of this process).",
            "block_bbox": [
                136,
                169,
